-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, פרק 8, §8.2 מורה-מדריך
-- The teacher-instructor (מורה-מדריך): the work unit and the fixed
-- instruction allowance of 43% of the personal combined salary.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `8.2 מורה-מדריך`

@desc A teaching employee employed as a teacher-instructor, as far as section 8.2 asks about it.
DECLARE `teacher-instructor` HAS
    `personal combined salary`        IS A NUMBER @desc the employee's personal combined salary (השכר המשולב האישי) for the month; an input
    `instruction position fraction`   IS A NUMBER @desc the share of a full position the employee holds as a teacher-instructor (1 = a full position)
    `years as a teacher-instructor`   IS A NUMBER @desc seniority in the teacher-instructor role; section 8.2.6 makes the rate independent of it
    `civil-service work unit`         IS A NUMBER @desc the weekly work unit customary for state employees, which section 8.2.1 adopts; set outside the takanon, so an input

§§ `8.2.1 יחידת עבודה`

@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_2__ssec_8_2_1/p1
GIVEN t IS A `teacher-instructor`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `teacher-instructor's work unit` t IS
    t's `civil-service work unit`

-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_2__ssec_8_2_1/p2 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_2__ssec_8_2_1/p3 Source: a director-general's circular.

§§ `8.2.6 גמול הדרכה`

@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_2__ssec_8_2_6__para_1 akn:chp_8__sec_8_2__ssec_8_2_6__para_1/p2
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `teacher-instructor allowance rate` IS 0.43

-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_2__ssec_8_2_6__para_1/p3 Effective date of the 43% rate (from 1.1.01); the file encodes the rate in force and carries no dates.

-- The rate stays fixed and does not grow with seniority as a teacher-instructor:
-- the rate above takes no seniority, and the assertion below holds it.
@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_2__ssec_8_2_6__para_1/p4
GIVEN t IS A `teacher-instructor`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `rate for this teacher-instructor` t IS
    `teacher-instructor allowance rate`

@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_2__ssec_8_2_6__para_2__subpara_a
GIVEN t IS A `teacher-instructor`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `full-position instruction allowance` t IS
    `rate for this teacher-instructor` t TIMES t's `personal combined salary`

@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_2__ssec_8_2_6__para_2__subpara_b
GIVEN t IS A `teacher-instructor`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `instruction allowance` t IS
    `full-position instruction allowance` t TIMES t's `instruction position fraction`

@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_2__ssec_8_2_6__para_2__subpara_c
GIVEN t IS A `teacher-instructor`
      `the other components of the salary the hourly value is computed from` IS A NUMBER
          @desc the rest of the monthly base from which the overtime hourly value is derived (section 1.24); an input
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `overtime hourly-value base` t `the other components of the salary the hourly value is computed from` IS
    `the other components of the salary the hourly value is computed from` PLUS `instruction allowance` t

-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_2__ssec_8_2_6/p1 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_2__ssec_8_2_6/p2 Source: collective agreement of 23.12.90.
-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_2__ssec_8_2_6/p3 Source: collective agreement of 18.12.01.
-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_2__ssec_8_2_6/p4 Source: special collective agreement of 10.3.83, annex D.

§§ `8.2.7 גמול השתלמות`

-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_2__ssec_8_2_7/p1 A pointer to section 8.4.7 (the in-service training allowance for supervisors), encoded there.
-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_2__ssec_8_2_7/p2 Heading of an empty source list (אסמכתא).

-- Examples. The salary of 10,000 and the work unit of 42.5 are placeholders.
`a half-position teacher-instructor` MEANS
    `teacher-instructor` WITH
        `personal combined salary`      IS 10000
        `instruction position fraction` IS 0.5
        `years as a teacher-instructor` IS 3
        `civil-service work unit`       IS 42.5

`the same, ten years on` MEANS
    `teacher-instructor` WITH
        `personal combined salary`      IS 10000
        `instruction position fraction` IS 0.5
        `years as a teacher-instructor` IS 13
        `civil-service work unit`       IS 42.5

#ASSERT `instruction allowance` `a half-position teacher-instructor` EQUALS 2150
-- §8.2.6.1: seniority in the role does not move the allowance.
#ASSERT `instruction allowance` `a half-position teacher-instructor` EQUALS `instruction allowance` `the same, ten years on`
#ASSERT `overtime hourly-value base` `a half-position teacher-instructor` 10000 EQUALS 12150
